```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Página de Login</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe, #00f2fe);
        }

        .login {
            width: 350px;
            padding: 35px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .login h1 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .campo {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .campo label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #555;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .campo input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .campo input:focus {
            border-color: #4facfe;
        }

        .botao {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #4facfe;
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .botao:hover {
            background: #1689e8;
        }

        .opcoes {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .opcoes a {
            color: #1689e8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .cadastro {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
            color: #555;
        }

        .cadastro a {
            color: #1689e8;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="login">

        <h1>Login</h1>

        <form>

            <div class="campo">
                <label for="email">E-mail</label>
                <input 
                    type="email" 
                    id="email" 
                    placeholder="Digite seu e-mail"
                    required
                >
            </div>

            <div class="campo">
                <label for="senha">Senha</label>
                <input 
                    type="password" 
                    id="senha" 
                    placeholder="Digite sua senha"
                    required
                >
            </div>

            <div class="opcoes">
                <label>
                    <input type="checkbox">
                    Lembrar-me
                </label>

                <a href="#">Esqueci a senha</a>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="botao">
                Entrar
            </button>

        </form>

        <div class="cadastro">
            Não possui uma conta?
            <a href="#">Cadastre-se</a>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
